  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"573\" height=\"149\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>溫西爾</strong>家具系列專為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>幻想家具</strong></a> 模組設計，添加了功能齊全的家具，包括但不限於：<strong>儲物箱</strong>、<strong>抽屜</strong>、<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>等！</p><p>此家具系列的設計靈感主要來自《<strong>魔獸世界</strong>》的《<strong>暗影之境</strong>》資料片中的<strong>溫西爾</strong>誓盟。</p><h3>合成配方</h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>要製作<strong>溫西爾木板</strong>/<strong>溫西爾羊毛</strong>，您需要放入 <strong>#minecraft:planks</strong>/<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/stonecutter_planks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要製作<strong>溫西爾</strong>家具方塊，您需要在<strong>家具組裝台</strong>中放入 <strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>溫西爾木板</strong>和<strong>溫西爾羊毛</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在<strong>Discord</strong>上加入我們</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
